flowchart TD
  B[Browser tab] -->|HTTPS| P[Proxy: Traefik, or any other]
  A[MCP client] -->|HTTPS| P
  P -->|HTTP or TLS, port 3000| S[digin serve]
  S --> R["/api/v1: JSON API"]
  S --> L["/api/v1/live: server-sent events"]
  S --> M["/mcp and /oauth: MCP and its OAuth server"]
  S --> AU["/auth: OIDC sign-in, when configured"]
  S --> W["/: the embedded web app"]
  R --> ST[store: the only package that talks to PostgreSQL]
  M --> ST
  ST --> PG[(PostgreSQL 17)]
  R --> V[vault: sealed files under DIGIN_DATA_DIR/files]
  ST -. publishes after commit .-> H[realtime hub, in memory]
  H --> L
